{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12139","headline":"蓝田溪与渔者宿 · 钱起","name":"蓝田溪与渔者宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独游屡忘归，况此隐沦处。\n濯发清泠泉，月明不能去。\n更怜垂纶叟，静若沙上鹭。\n一论白云心，千里沧洲趣。\n芦中夜火尽，浦口秋山曙。\n叹息分枝禽，何时更相遇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「蓝田溪与渔者宿」条、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"徐应佩 周溶泉"}